# Colang rules for the input gate.
#
# The "self check input" flow (used in config.yml) is provided by the NeMo
# library. When it decides to block, it calls "bot refuse to respond" and stops.
# We override that bot message here so a blocked message returns OUR wording
# (kept consistent with the responder's _BLOCKED_MSG).

define bot refuse to respond
  "I can't help with that request. I'm an enterprise technical assistant — feel free to ask me about the topics in the knowledge base."
